---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/astro/Breadcrumb.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Cookie Notice | Gibraltar For Sale" description="Cookie and technology notice for the first release of Gibraltar For Sale. Application trackers and project-level optional analytics injection are disabled.">
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} />
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px] px-5 pb-20 pt-10 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-16">
    <p class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-sea-700">First-release notice</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-6xl">Cookies and similar technologies</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-stone-600">Status as at 8 November 2026 · Review before enabling non-essential technologies.</p>
    <div class="article-content mt-8">
      <p>The first release is statically generated. Its application code does not integrate optional analytics, advertising, session replay or marketing tags, and the project-level optional analytics injection and Manus badge scripts are disabled. There are no accounts or saved-search features in this release.</p>
      <h2 id="hosting">Hosting and external links</h2>
      <p>The platform that delivers the website may process technical requests or operate technologies required to deliver and secure it. Other platform or CDN analytics may remain, so this notice does not claim that every technical identifier, cookie or log has been stopped. The publisher has not supplied detailed platform retention settings. Links to other organisations lead to websites with their own technology notices.</p>
      <h2 id="future-tools">If optional tools are added</h2>
      <p>Before introducing analytics, advertising, session replay or other non-essential storage, the operator must document the tools, purposes, data recipients and retention periods, update the privacy and cookie notices, and implement an appropriate consent mechanism. No optional application tag should load before any required consent.</p>
      <h2 id="contact">Questions</h2>
      <p>Verified operator contact details are not yet published. Please do not send personal information through this site; see the <a href="/contact/">contact-status page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
